sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Envoy as Envoy Proxy (Gateway)<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant IPP as IPP (ext-proc)<br/>9004/TCP gRPC/HTTP2<br/>Self-signed TLS
    participant DataLayer as Data Layer<br/>(in-process)
    participant Datastore as In-Memory Datastore<br/>(in-process)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Pool as InferencePool<br/>(HTTPRoute match)
    participant EPP as llm-d Router (EPP)<br/>(pod selection)
    participant ModelSrv as Model Server (vLLM)<br/>8000/TCP HTTP

    Note over Client,ModelSrv: Flow 1: Inference Request Routing (Multi-Pool)

    Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    Envoy->>IPP: ext-proc: RequestHeaders event<br/>gRPC streaming (self-signed TLS)

    Note over IPP: Plugin pipeline begins

    IPP->>IPP: body-field-to-header plugin:<br/>Extract model → X-Gateway-Model-Name
    IPP->>IPP: base-model-to-header plugin:<br/>Lookup adapter → base model mapping
    IPP->>IPP: Model Selector: Filter → Score → Pick<br/>(reads from Datastore)
    IPP-->>Envoy: ext-proc response:<br/>Add headers: X-Gateway-Model-Name,<br/>X-Gateway-Base-Model-Name<br/>Mutate body if model selected

    Note over IPP,DataLayer: Async: emit event to buffered channel (cap 10K)
    IPP-)DataLayer: Request event notification

    Envoy->>Pool: Route via HTTPRoute<br/>(match X-Gateway-Base-Model-Name header)
    Pool->>EPP: Select pod within pool
    EPP->>ModelSrv: Forward inference request<br/>HTTP/8000
    ModelSrv-->>EPP: Inference response (streaming SSE)
    EPP-->>Pool: Response
    Pool-->>Envoy: Response

    Envoy->>IPP: ext-proc: ResponseHeaders event
    IPP->>IPP: model-name-to-header plugin:<br/>Extract model from response
    IPP-->>Envoy: ext-proc response: Add response headers

    Envoy->>IPP: ext-proc: ResponseBody event
    IPP->>IPP: Response plugins process body
    IPP-->>Envoy: ext-proc response

    Note over IPP,DataLayer: Async: emit response event
    IPP-)DataLayer: Response event notification

    Envoy-->>Client: Inference response

    Note over DataLayer,Datastore: Async event processing (eventual consistency)
    DataLayer->>Datastore: request-metadata-extractor:<br/>Update in-flight counts
    DataLayer->>Datastore: request-cost-metadata-extractor:<br/>Update cost t-digest distributions

    Note over Client,ModelSrv: Flow 2: ConfigMap Reconciliation (Background)

    K8sAPI->>IPP: ConfigMap watch event<br/>(label: inference.llm-d.ai/ipp-managed)
    IPP->>IPP: Reconcile AdaptersStore:<br/>Update adapter → base model mappings
    Note over IPP: base-model-to-header plugin<br/>now uses updated mappings

    Note over Client,ModelSrv: Flow 3: Model Config File Watch (Background)

    Note over IPP: model-config-collector:<br/>fsnotify detects file change<br/>(250ms debounce)
    IPP->>Datastore: Update model names,<br/>pricing, group memberships
